    {
      "type": "intro",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "hero",
        "style": "padding-top:60px;"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-eyebrow"
          },
          "html": "🌙 · Solo · Guided audio · AI"
        },
        {
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Your space.<br>Your rules.<br><em>Your pace.</em>"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "Caresse is an AI-guided intimate audio experience for solo exploration. A private space to reconnect with your sensations, explore your imagination, and take care of yourself — without pressure, without performance, without anyone watching."
        },
        {
          "tag": "div",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-group"
          },
          "html": "\n            <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                \n                <span class=\"inline\">Download for free</span>\n            </a>\n        "
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero-badge"
          },
          "html": "Anonymous mode · No Caresse sign-up · Free demos<br>Paid personalized sessions, no subscription."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "benefits"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Why explore solo with Caresse?"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "A space that's entirely yours."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-sub"
          },
          "html": "No performance to give. No expectations to meet. Just you, a voice, and all the time you need."
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "benefits-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🌙</div>\n                \n                <h3>Zero pressure</h3>\n                \n                <p>Solo exploration with Caresse has no rules. Go at your own pace, stop whenever you want, start over as many times as you need.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">🧭</div>\n                \n                <h3>Explore the unknown</h3>\n                \n                <p>Caresse guides you toward experiences you might not have dared to explore alone. Every session is different, every session is safe.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">💜</div>\n                \n                <h3>Take care of yourself</h3>\n                \n                <p>Intimacy with yourself is an act of self-care. Caresse creates a dedicated space for your emotional and sensory well-being.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "benefit-card"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"icon\">✨</div>\n                \n                <h3>Always unique</h3>\n                \n                <p>Every session is AI-generated around your current mood. Never the same experience twice — your curiosity is always fed.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "how"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "How it works"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "Your solo experience in 4 steps"
        },
        {
          "type": "cards",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "steps-grid"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">01</div>\n                \n                <h3>Choose solo mode</h3>\n                \n                <p>Create your profile with an alias. Your real data stays yours — complete privacy.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">02</div>\n                \n                <h3>Define your desires</h3>\n                \n                <p>Atmosphere, tone, intensity, practices — everything is customizable. Explore the options without judgment.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">03</div>\n                \n                <h3>Wait for your session</h3>\n                \n                <p>Caresse generates your unique experience in moments. Notification as soon as it's ready.</p>\n            "
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "step-item"
              },
              "html": "\n                <div class=\"num\">04</div>\n                \n                <h3>Settle in and listen</h3>\n                \n                <p>Headphones, dimmed lights, your space. Close your eyes and let the voice guide you at your own pace.</p>\n            "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "compare-note",
            "style": "margin-top:32px;"
          },
          "html": "Want to hear that voice before installing the app? <a href=\"/en/demo/solo-sensual-discovery/\">Listen to a Caresse solo demo</a> — four minutes with Maya, guidance addressed to one person, attentive to pace and breathing, no account or email needed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "faq"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-label"
          },
          "html": "Frequently asked questions"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h2",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "section-title"
          },
          "html": "What you want to know"
        },
        {
          "type": "faq",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq-list"
          },
          "prefix": "",
          "suffix": "",
          "items": [
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can I buy sessions in anonymous mode?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes. Anonymous mode lets you use Caresse and buy sessions without creating a Caresse account. Purchases go through the App Store or Google Play and require an Apple or Google account on the store you use, with its payment method. Anonymous mode applies to your use of Caresse, not to the transaction with the store."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can Caresse really be used alone?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Absolutely. Solo mode is a pillar of Caresse, just as complete and customizable as duo mode. The experience is designed to be fulfilling solo — not a \"reduced\" version of couple mode."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Do my preferences remain private?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes — your preferences and profile are never shared or used for commercial purposes. No third party has access to your session history. The experience remains strictly between you and the app."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Does the content adapt to my tastes?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Every session is generated to measure based on your current preferences — atmosphere, tone, intensity, practices. You're never locked into a fixed profile: you can change everything with each session."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can solo exploration help me know myself better?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "This is often the most unexpected effect. By exploring different configurations without pressure or outside gaze, many users discover preferences they wouldn't have identified otherwise."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "How long is a solo session?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Duration varies based on your preferences — generally between 25 and 35 minutes. You can stop at any time, resume later, or launch a new session immediately."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-item"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tag": "h3",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Can I use Caresse even if I'm in a relationship?"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Yes — solo mode is independent from duo mode. Many users in relationships use Caresse individually to explore alone, then share the experience in duo mode at other times."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
